begin="4:16.094" end="4:17.259">do u</span><span begin="4:17.259" end="4:18.593">o mo u</span><span begin="4:19.020" end="4:19.130">ko</span><span begin="4:19.130" end="4:20.246">re</span><span begin="4:20.246" end="4:20.497">ka</span><span begin="4:20.497" end="4:21.006">ra</span><span begin="4:21.388" end="4:22.032">fu ta</span><span begin="4:22.032" end="4:22.554">ri</span><span begin="4:22.554" end="4:22.860">de</span><span begin="4:22.860" end="4:23.684">ya</span><span begin="4:23.684" end="4:24.425">tte</span><span begin="4:24.816" end="4:25.023">i</span><span begin="4:25.023" end="4:25.174">ke</span><span begin="4:25.174" end="4:25.507">ru</span><span begin="4:25.507" end="4:25.857">to</span><span begin="4:25.857" end="4:26.345">o mo</span><span begin="4:26.345" end="4:27.352">u</span></text><text for="L36"><span begin="4:27.799" end="4:27.929">n</span><span begin="4:27.929" end="4:28.163">n</span><span begin="4:28.163" end="4:29.281">do u</span><span begin="4:29.281" end="4:29.547">ka</span><span begin="4:29.547" end="4:30.229">na a</span><span begin="4:30.404" end="4:30.794">de</span><span begin="4:30.794" end="4:31.147">mo</span><span begin="4:31.147" end="4:31.530">to</span><span begin="4:31.530" end="4:31.878">ri</span><span begin="4:31.878" end="4:32.225">a e</span><span begin="4:32.225" end="4:32.516">zu</span><span begin="4:32.516" end="4:33.275">wa</span></text><text for="L37"><span begin="4:33.809" end="4:34.155">bo ku</span><span begin="4:34.155" end="4:34.511">wa</span><span begin="4:34.511" end="4:35.290">ki mi</span><span begin="4:35.290" end="4:35.439">ga</span><span begin="4:35.439" end="4:36.402">su</span><span begin="4:36.402" end="4:36.805">ki</span><span begin="4:36.805" end="4:37.142">da</span><span begin="4:37.142" end="4:39.234">yo</span></text></transliteration></transliterations><songwriters><songwriter>清水依与吏</songwriter><songwriter>Iyori Shimizu</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="4:39.234"><div begin="28.146" end="4:39.234"><p begin="28.146" end="39.418" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.146" end="29.243">どう</span><span begin="29.243" end="30.609">思う?</span><span begin="30.937" end="31.123">こ</span><span begin="31.123" end="32.145">れ</span><span begin="32.286" end="32.570">か</span><span begin="32.570" end="33.058">ら</span><span begin="33.425" end="34.040">二</span><span begin="34.040" end="34.476">人</span><span begin="34.547" end="34.902">で</span><span begin="34.902" end="35.573">やっ</span><span begin="35.660" end="36.383">て</span><span begin="36.763" end="36.996">い</span><span begin="36.996" end="37.113">け</span><span begin="37.113" end="37.506">る</span><span begin="37.506" end="37.855">と</span><span begin="37.855" end="39.418">思う?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你觉得呢？你觉得今后我们两个人能一起走下去吗？</span></p><p begin="39.824" end="45.378" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.824" end="39.964">ん</span><span begin="39.964" end="40.144">ん</span><span begin="40.144" end="41.221">どう</span><span begin="41.221" end="41.539">か</span><span begin="41.539" end="42.242">なぁ</span><span begin="42.363" end="42.774">で</span><span begin="42.774" end="43.120">も</span><span begin="43.120" end="43.486">と</span><span begin="43.486" end="43.872">り</span><span begin="43.872" end="44.198">あえ</span><span begin="44.198" end="44.439">ず</span><span begin="44.439" end="45.375">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">嗯，不好说呢，不过眼下</span></p><p begin="45.796" end="51.645" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.796" end="46.072">一</span><span begin="46.072" end="46.498">緒</span><span begin="46.498" end="46.862">にい</span><span begin="46.862" end="47.489">たい</span><span begin="47.489" end="47.906">と</span><span begin="48.051" end="49.187">思っ</span><span begin="49.187" end="49.930">て</span><span begin="49.930" end="50.298">る</span><span begin="50.298" end="50.525">け</span><span begin="50.525" end="51.645">ど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我还是想和你在一起</span></p><p begin="52.026" end="1:03.348" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.026" end="53.281">そう</span><span begin="53.281" end="53.540">だ</span><span begin="53.540" end="54.425">ね</span><span begin="54.777" end="55.076">だ</span><span begin="55.076" end="56.220">け</span><span begin="56.220" end="56.449">ど</span><span begin="56.449" end="57.063">さ</span><span begin="57.341" end="58.155">最</span><span begin="58.155" end="58.532">後</span><span begin="58.532" end="58.932">は</span><span begin="58.932" end="59.925">私</span><span begin="59.925" end="1:00.416">が</span><span begin="1:00.788" end="1:00.991">フ</span><span begin="1:00.991" end="1:01.161">ラ</span><span begin="1:01.161" end="1:01.416">れ</span><span begin="1:01.416" end="1:01.546">る</span><span begin="1:01.546" end="1:01.690">と</span><span begin="1:01.690" end="1:02.132">思</span><span begin="1:02.132" end="1:02.294">う</span><span begin="1:02.294" end="1:03.348">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">也是呢，可是啊，我觉得最后被甩的会是我</span></p><p begin="1:03.795" end="1:09.412" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.795" end="1:03.970">ん</span><span begin="1:03.970" end="1:04.130">ん</span><span begin="1:04.130" end="1:05.285">どう</span><span begin="1:05.285" end="1:05.523">か</span><span begin="1:05.523" end="1:06.285">なぁ</span><span begin="1:06.395" end="1:06.788">で</span><span begin="1:06.788" end="1:07.140">も</span><span begin="1:07.140" end="1:07.528">と</span><span begin="1:07.528" end="1:07.905">り</span><span begin="1:07.905" end="1:08.226">あえ</span><span begin="1:08.226" end="1:08.516">ず</span><span begin="1:08.516" end="1:09.412">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">嗯，不好说呢，不过眼下</span></p><p begin="1:09.817" end="1:15.334" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.817" end="1:10.037">一</span><span begin="1:10.037" end="1:10.495">緒</span><span begin="1:10.495" end="1:10.897">に</span><span begin="1:10.897" end="1:11.292">い</span><span begin="1:11.292" end="1:11.660">て</span><span begin="1:11.660" end="1:12.362">み</span><span begin="1:12.362" end="1:12.798">よ</span><span begin="1:12.798" end="1:12.994">う</span><span begin="1:12.994" end="1:15.334">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">就先试着在一起吧</span></p><p begin="1:16.109" end="1:21.448" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.109" end="1:16.846">浮</span><span begin="1:16.846" end="1:17.094">気</span><span begin="1:17.094" end="1:17.499">し</span><span begin="1:17.499" end="1:17.953">て</span><span begin="1:17.953" end="1:18.380">も</span><span begin="1:18.380" end="1:18.741">言</span><span begin="1:18.741" end="1:19.104">わ</span><span begin="1:19.104" end="1:19.503">な</span><span begin="1:19.503" end="1:19.887">い</span><span begin="1:19.887" end="1:20.090">で</span><span begin="1:20.090" end="1:20.253">よ</span><span begin="1:20.253" end="1:21.448">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">就算出轨了，也别告诉我哦</span></p><p begin="1:21.774" end="1:27.895" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.774" end="1:22.100">知</span><span begin="1:22.100" end="1:22.521">ら</span><span begin="1:22.521" end="1:22.869">な</span><span begin="1:22.869" end="1:23.171">け</span><span begin="1:23.171" end="1:23.498">れ</span><span begin="1:23.498" end="1:23.978">ば</span><span begin="1:23.978" end="1:24.684">悲</span><span begin="1:24.684" end="1:25.127">し</span><span begin="1:25.127" end="1:25.522">く</span><span begin="1:25.522" end="1:25.861">は</span><span begin="1:25.861" end="1:26.126">な</span><span begin="1:26.126" end="1:26.272">ら</span><span begin="1:26.272" end="1:27.040">な</span><span begin="1:27.040" end="1:27.389">い</span><span begin="1:27.389" end="1:27.586">で</span><span begin="1:27.586" end="1:27.895">しょ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">只要不知道，就不会难过了吧</span></p><p begin="1:28.088" end="1:33.360" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.088" end="1:28.481">信</span><span begin="1:28.481" end=