 end="3:42.630">カ</span><span begin="3:42.630" end="3:42.920">も</span><span begin="3:42.920" end="3:43.168">す</span><span begin="3:43.168" end="3:43.507">るん</span><span begin="3:43.507" end="3:43.886">だ</span><span begin="3:43.886" end="3:44.255">ろう</span><span begin="3:44.255" end="3:44.492">け</span><span begin="3:44.492" end="3:45.392">ど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">虽然我们大概也会吵架</span></p><p begin="3:45.669" end="3:50.832" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:45.669" end="3:45.955">そ</span><span begin="3:45.955" end="3:46.149">れ</span><span begin="3:46.149" end="3:46.397">な</span><span begin="3:46.397" end="3:46.530">ら</span><span begin="3:46.530" end="3:46.888">何</span><span begin="3:46.888" end="3:47.296">回</span><span begin="3:47.296" end="3:48.023">だっ</span><span begin="3:48.023" end="3:48.759">て</span><span begin="3:48.759" end="3:49.139">何</span><span begin="3:49.139" end="3:49.530">十</span><span begin="3:49.530" end="3:49.914">回</span><span begin="3:49.914" end="3:50.470">だっ</span><span begin="3:50.470" end="3:50.832">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那样的话，无论多少次，哪怕几十次</span></p><p begin="3:51.005" end="3:57.535" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:51.005" end="3:51.623">謝</span><span begin="3:51.623" end="3:51.697">る</span><span begin="3:51.697" end="3:51.901">し</span><span begin="3:51.901" end="3:52.493">感</span><span begin="3:52.493" end="3:52.686">謝</span><span begin="3:52.686" end="3:52.872">の</span><span begin="3:52.872" end="3:53.251">言</span><span begin="3:53.251" end="3:53.507">葉</span><span begin="3:53.507" end="3:53.654">も</span><span begin="3:53.654" end="3:54.031">きっ</span><span begin="3:54.031" end="3:54.517">と</span><span begin="3:54.758" end="3:55.445">忘</span><span begin="3:55.445" end="3:55.733">れ</span><span begin="3:55.733" end="3:56.097">ない</span><span begin="3:56.097" end="3:56.251">か</span><span begin="3:56.251" end="3:57.535">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我都会道歉，也一定不会忘记说谢谢</span></p><p begin="3:57.764" end="4:04.281" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:57.764" end="3:58.499">君</span><span begin="3:58.499" end="3:58.728">と</span><span begin="3:58.728" end="3:59.240">な</span><span begin="3:59.240" end="3:59.519">ら</span><span begin="3:59.519" end="4:00.005">ど</span><span begin="4:00.005" end="4:00.227">ん</span><span begin="4:00.227" end="4:00.776">な</span><span begin="4:00.776" end="4:01.507">朝</span><span begin="4:01.507" end="4:01.710">も</span><span begin="4:01.710" end="4:02.262">夜</span><span begin="4:02.262" end="4:02.654">も</span><span begin="4:02.898" end="4:03.224">夕</span><span begin="4:03.224" end="4:03.623">方</span><span begin="4:03.623" end="4:03.952">だっ</span><span begin="4:03.952" end="4:04.281">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">只要和你在一起，无论怎样的清晨、夜晚或黄昏</span></p><p begin="4:04.281" end="4:08.652" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:04.281" end="4:04.915">笑い</span><span begin="4:04.915" end="4:05.271">合っ</span><span begin="4:05.271" end="4:05.428">て</span><span begin="4:05.428" end="4:05.906">生</span><span begin="4:05.906" end="4:06.373">き</span><span begin="4:06.373" end="4:06.734">て</span><span begin="4:06.734" end="4:06.989">い</span><span begin="4:06.989" end="4:07.189">け</span><span begin="4:07.189" end="4:07.478">るん</span><span begin="4:07.478" end="4:07.894">じゃ</span><span begin="4:07.894" end="4:08.260">ない</span><span begin="4:08.260" end="4:08.504">か</span><span begin="4:08.504" end="4:08.652">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我们都能相视而笑，一起生活下去吧</span></p><p begin="4:08.857" end="4:11.289" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:08.857" end="4:09.217">思</span><span begin="4:09.217" end="4:09.581">うん</span><span begin="4:09.581" end="4:09.788">だ</span><span begin="4:09.788" end="4:11.289">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我是这么想的啊</span></p><p begin="4:16.094" end="4:27.352" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:16.094" end="4:17.259">どう</span><span begin="4:17.259" end="4:18.593">思う?</span><span begin="4:19.020" end="4:19.130">こ</span><span begin="4:19.130" end="4:20.246">れ</span><span begin="4:20.246" end="4:20.497">か</span><span begin="4:20.497" end="4:21.006">ら</span><span begin="4:21.388" end="4:22.032">二</span><span begin="4:22.032" end="4:22.554">人</span><span begin="4:22.554" end="4:22.860">で</span><span begin="4:22.860" end="4:23.684">やっ</span><span begin="4:23.684" end="4:24.425">て</span><span begin="4:24.816" end="4:25.023">い</span><span begin="4:25.023" end="4:25.174">け</span><span begin="4:25.174" end="4:25.507">る</span><span begin="4:25.507" end="4:25.857">と</span><span begin="4:25.857" end="4:26.345">思</span><span begin="4:26.345" end="4:27.352">う?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你觉得呢？你觉得今后我们两个人能一起走下去吗？</span></p><p begin="4:27.799" end="4:33.275" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:27.799" end="4:27.929">ん</span><span begin="4:27.929" end="4:28.163">ん</span><span begin="4:28.163" end="4:29.281">どう</span><span begin="4:29.281" end="4:29.547">か</span><span begin="4:29.547" end="4:30.229">なぁ</span><span begin="4:30.404" end="4:30.794">で</span><span begin="4:30.794" end="4:31.147">も</span><span begin="4:31.147" end="4:31.530">と</span><span begin="4:31.530" end="4:31.878">り</span><span begin="4:31.878" end="4:32.225">あえ</span><span begin="4:32.225" end="4:32.516">ず</span><span begin="4:32.516" end="4:33.275">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">嗯，不好说呢，不过至少现在</span></p><p begin="4:33.809" end="4:39.234" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:33.809" end="4:34.155">僕</span><span begin="4:34.155" end="4:34.511">は</span><span begin="4:34.511" end="4:35.290">君</span><span begin="4:35.290" end="4:35.439">が</span><span begin="4:35.439" end="4:36.402">好</span><span begin="4:36.402" end="4:36.805">き</span><span begin="4:36.805" end="4:37.142">だ</span><span begin="4:37.142" end="4:39.234">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我是喜欢你的啊</span></p></div></body></tt>